        ^"Ancient Rider" DEF {
            ^"Description" STRING "A Dark Moto bushi is an Otherworldly, Tainted being. When making an Attack action while on horseback, a Dark Moto bushi may spend (op)(op)+ to move 1 range band per (op)(op) spent this way after resolving the action."
        }

        RULES {
            #L5RSH11qR1sT3uV5wX7yZ9aB: dark_moto_bushi "The warriors who followed Moto Tsume into the Shadowlands are now as horrid as their surroundings. Their forms are as corrupted as their souls, having taken on aspects of spiked bone or diseased skin, and their armor can be as misshapen as their flesh. They fight with disciplined order and powerful kata, some still using their ancestral Ujik weapons. Worse, having fallen completely to the Taint despite their honor and courage, the Dark Moto are terrible reminders that no one is immune to such a fate."
        }
    }

