        ^"Deadly Steed" DEF {
            ^"Description" STRING "If the rider is a Dark Moto, when making an Attack action check, the rider may spend (op) to have their mount lash out with its teeth and hooves, inflicting 5 damage with the Unholy quality on a character at range 0-1."
        }

        RULES {
            #L5RSH14aB4cD6eF8gH0iJ2kL: dark_moto_onikage "Dark Moto onikage are elite demonic mounts formed from the Unicorn steeds of the Moto. Like their riders, they are corrupted and terrible in appearance, with reptilian hides and crimson eyes. These steeds use the profile for onikage, adding the following additional ability:"
        }
