            ^"Gear" LIST OF STRING ["Tattered robes (Physical 1, Supernatural 2)"]
        }

        ^"Eternally Vigilant" DEF {
            ^"Description" STRING "The Watcher is an Otherworldly, Tainted being that always uses its focus value for Initiative checks. When it inflicts a Permanent Injury on a target, that target is always assigned the Lost Eye disadvantage, and the Watcher removes 5 fatigue from itself (as well as growing a new eye on its body)."
        }

        RULES {
            #L5RSH22sT2uV4wX6yZ8aB0cD: the_watcher "The Watcher is usually encountered at a high vantage point in Daylight Castle. Kuni occult scholars believe it to be an low form of oni, but there is much disagreement on the topic. It resembles a man in a tattered kimono, but its pale flesh is punctuated by dozens of eyes that blink in waves that ripple across its body. Because these many eyes can apparently see, it is almost impossible to take the Watcher by surprise. It attacks its prey in an especially horrifying way: the eye sockets in the standard location on its face appear empty and black, but they can gape wide, revealing themselves to be wickedly fanged mouths. These bite at its opponents' eyes; if successful, not only does it gouge out its victim's eyes, blinding them, but new eyes appear on the Watcher's body."
        }
    }

