            #L5RSHoniGen04monstrousWarr: monstrous_warrior_oni "The raw power of this profile is appropriate for a wide variety of deadly oni antagonists. Such foes tend toward unsubtle displays of force, but they are fully capable of cunning and devious tactics when appropriate."
